   PRIME IMPLICANTS are present, in src/scram/zbdd.rs, porting
   Zbdd::ConvertBddPrimeImplicants together with Bdd::Consensus (which is
   Apply<kAnd> on an if-then-else node's two branches). Upstream's module
   handling and its EliminateComplements are not ported.

   A ZBDD IS present, in src/scram/zbdd.rs, porting Zbdd::ConvertBdd,
   Zbdd::Minimize and Zbdd::Subsume with attribution. Upstream's module
   handling, its ConvertBddPrimeImplicants path and its EliminateComplements
